        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Vier Prinzipien.<br><em class="serif-italic">Eine Marke.</em>{% else %}Four principles.<br><em class="serif-italic">One brand.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="aside">
        <p class="lead">{% if lang == "de" %}Was unsere Maschinen ausmacht, lässt sich nicht in Datenblättern allein ablesen. Es ist eine Haltung — präzise, robust, zuverlässig.{% else %}What makes our machines stand out cannot be read from datasheets alone. It is an attitude — precise, robust, reliable.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-4 reveal">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--brand-light); font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em;">01</div>
        <h3 class="mt-3" style="color: var(--canvas); font-size: 1.25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Robustheit{% else %}Robustness{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--steel-400); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55;">{% if lang == "de" %}Konstruktion auf Lebenszeit. Jeder Rahmen aus dem LIBA-Werk hält Jahrzehnte unter realen Bau­bedingungen.{% else %}Built for a lifetime. Every frame from the LIBA factory holds up for decades under real construction conditions.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--brand-light); font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em;">02</div>
        <h3 class="mt-3" style="color: var(--canvas); font-size: 1.25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Präzision{% else %}Precision{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--steel-400); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55;">{% if lang == "de" %}Reproduzierbare Grabengeometrien — der Unterschied zwischen Vortrieb und Improvisation.{% else %}Reproducible trench geometry — the difference between progress and improvisation.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--brand-light); font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em;">03</div>
        <h3 class="mt-3" style="color: var(--canvas); font-size: 1.25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Innovation{% else %}Innovation{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--steel-400); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55;">{% if lang == "de" %}Neue Werkzeugbestückungen, neue Trägerkonzepte — wir entwickeln das, was die Trasse von morgen braucht.{% else %}New tooling configurations, new carrier concepts — we develop what tomorrow's routes will demand.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--brand-light); font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em;">04</div>
        <h3 class="mt-3" style="color: var(--canvas); font-size: 1.25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Verlässlichkeit{% else %}Reliability{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2" style="color: var(--steel-400); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55;">{% if lang == "de" %}Direkter Werkskontakt, Ersatzteile aus dem eigenen Lager, persönliche Ansprechpartner — keine Hotline-Kette.{% else %}Direct factory contact, spare parts from our own stock, personal points of contact — no call-centre chain.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

